TITLE    FILE 3 Bits D-Counter
PATTERN  1
AUTHOR   J. ENGINEER
REVISION Created from PLA file 
COMPANY  AMD
DATE     Mon Nov 09 21:45:48 2026

CHIP     3COUNT_D MACH111
PIN    1            GND 
PIN   12            GND 
PIN   22            VCC 
PIN   23            GND 
PIN   34            GND 
PIN   44            VCC 
PIN    ?            CLK 
PIN    ?         ENABLE 
PIN    ?            RST 
PIN    ?           B[2]  REG ;
PIN    ?           B[1]  REG ;
PIN    ?           B[0]  REG ;

EQUATIONS

B[2]          := B[2] * /B[1]
               + B[2] * /B[0]
               + /ENABLE * B[2]
               + ENABLE * /B[2] * B[1] * B[0]

B[2].RSTF      = RST

B[2].CLKF      = CLK

B[1]          := B[1] * /B[0]
               + /ENABLE * B[1]
               + ENABLE * /B[1] * B[0]

B[1].RSTF      = RST

B[1].CLKF      = CLK

B[0]          := ENABLE * /B[0]

B[0].RSTF      = RST

B[0].CLKF      = CLK

